<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- KUTU Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ya Ichanduso ya Paulo kwa wanhu wa ako Kolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa ya Ichanduso ya Paulo kwa wanhu wa ako</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">1 Wakolinto chandikigwa na mtumigwa Paulo behi na mwaka wa 55 toka kuvumbuka kwa Kilisito (Sula ya 1:1). Ino ayo baluwa ya ichanduso mna zibaluwa mbili ziyandike Paulo kwa wanhu wamtogole Yesu mna ikibumbila ako Kolinto. Yogesigwa kandika baluwa ino mna ikipindi kiyakalile ako Efeso yang'hali hanagesa kutembelela Kolinto mmwanza wake wa kuchola na kubwela Makedonia (Sula ya 16:5-9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa ino yokwidika usenga ugaligwe kwa Paulo na wanhu wayagwe walawile mna ikibumbila cha wanhu wamtogole Yesu mbuli ya nzambi mna ikibumbila acho, mbuli za kuigola na ugoni. Buga da Kolinto dijuwika ng'hani mbuli ya ugoni, avo hatukanganya wanhu wa kibumbila cha wanhu wamtogole Yesu wakala mzimbuli zizo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili mkitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo kowalamusa wanhu wa ako Kolinto na komgwaa Imulungu nhogolwa mbuli yao (Sula ya 1:1-9).</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho kolonga usenga uyabokele mbuli ya kuigola kwa kibumbila cha wanhu wamtogole Yesu ako Kolinto (Sula ya 1:10-4:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho kowalongela mbuli za ugoni na mbuli za wao kuigala mvitala (Sula ya 5-6).</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho kolava malagizo mbuli ya kusola na kusoligwa, kuvitambikila vinyago na kutambikila kunze kunze, nhunza za kiloho na kuzilibuligwa (Sula ya 7-15).</para>
  <para style="io">Kukimambukizo kolonga gaja gakusang'hana na gaja goyolonda kusang'hana (Sula ya 16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Niye Paulo, nikemigwa niwe mtumigwa wa Yesu Kilisito, kamba viyalondile Imulungu, na vivija ndugu yetu Sositenesi, <verse eid="1CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>towandikila mweye wanhu wa Imulungu muli kudibuga da Kolinto. Mweye mose mukemigwe muwe wanhu wang'alile wa Imulungu, mweye mwa wanhu wa Imulungu kwa kuilumba na Yesu Kilisito, hamoja na wanhu wose weli kila hanhu omgwaa ukulu Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito, Mndewa wao na vivija Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Imulungu Tataetu na Mndewa Yesu Kilisito wawagwee ng'hekewa na tindiwalo.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vinhu vinogile kubitila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Siku zose niye nomgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu wangu, kwavija kawagwaa mweye ng'hekewa, kubitila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Kwavija mweye muilumba na Kilisito, mugweleligwa vinhu vose vinogile, mugweleligwa nzewele zose na kujuwa mbuli zose zimulonga. <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>Usenga mbuli ya Kilisito, Imulungu kautenda wike mizizi mmizoyo yenu, <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>avo hamuswelile nhunza yoyose ilawa kwa Loho Yang'alile, kipindi vimumbeta kwa kusulukila Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito vonda yagubuligwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Nayo kowagangamiza mbaka kuuhelelo, ili sikumoneke mubananga mna Isiku ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Imulungu yawakemile mweye muilumbe na Mwanage, Yesu Kilisito Mndewa wetu, kotenda gaja gayalongile.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wamtogole Kilisito oigola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Ndugu zangu, nowapula kwa twaga da Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito, muitogolele mbuli yoyose yumulonga, ili sikumuigole mweye kwa mweye. Muilumbe goya na mugese dimoja na mulonde kinhu kimoja. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Ndugu zangu, wanhu wayagwe wa lukolo lwa Kiloe wanongela fulu ipile kuwa mogomba mweye kwa mweye. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Niye nolonga vino, kwavija kila munhu kolonga jake. Ino kolonga, “Nomkweleleza Paulo,” iyagwe kolonga, “Nomkweleleza Apolo,” iyagwe kolonga, “Nomkweleleza Kefa,” na iyagwe kolonga, “Nomkweleleza Kilisito.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Vino, Kilisito kaigola? Vino, Paulo ayo yawambigwe mumsalaba mbuli ya mweye? Hebu mubatizigwa muwe wanahina wa Paulo?<verse eid="1CO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Nomgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu kwavija simbatize munhu yoyose kumwenu, ila niwabatiza Kilisipo na Gayo. <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Avo kuduhu munhu yodaha kulonga kabatizigwa kuwa mwanahina wangu. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Ona vija, vivija niwabatiza wanhu wa lubuga lwa Sitefana, lakini sikumbuka kamba nimbatiza munhu yoyose iyagwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Kilisito hanitumile niye kubatiza, lakini kanituma niwapetele wanhu Mbuli Inogile, na siyo kwa kutamanila nzewele za wanhu, ili kuitenda ifa ya Kilisito mumsalaba sikuyage bule.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito ayo nguvu na nzewele ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Kwavija usenga mbuli ya ifa ya Kilisito mumsalaba yokoneka mbuli ya kibozi kwa wanhu opotela, lakini kumwetu siye tukomboligwa, usenga awo ni nguvu ya Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Kwavija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Nozibananga nzewele za wanhu weli na nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">na ubala wa wanhu nowasa kutali.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Avo, kakwahi yeli na nzewele? Hebu mfundiza Malagizo ga Musa? Hebu wakulu wa kuibamilila wa kipindi kino? Imulungu kaitenda nzewele ya wanhu wa mwiisi ino ubozi!<verse eid="1CO 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Kamba viili nzewele ya Imulungu, wanhu wa mwiisi hawadaha kumjuwa heyo kubitila nzewele zao wenyego. Lakini Imulungu kanogelwa kuwakombola waja omtogola kubitila usenga awo utuwapetela na ukoneka kwa wanhu weli na nzewele kamba ubozi. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Wayahudi olonda kulola kilaguso, Wagiliki ozahila nzewele. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Lakini siye tompeta Kilisito yawambigwe mumsalaba. Usenga uno owagevuza Wayahudi na kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi okoneka ubozi. <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>Lakini kwa waja wakemigwe na Imulungu, Wayahudi hamoja na haweli Wayahudi, Kilisito ayo nguvu ya Imulungu na nzewele za Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Kwavija kija kikoneka ubozi wa Imulungu, kina nzewele kubanza nzewele za wanhu, na kija kikoneka kunyolila kwa Imulungu, kina nguvu kubanza nguvu za wanhu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Ndugu zangu, kumbukeni vimukalile baho umwaka Imulungu viyawakemile, wanhu bwando kumwenu wakala wabule hata nzewele za wanhu wa mwiisi ino, wanhu bwando wakala wabule nguvu hebu weli na ukulu. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Lakini Imulungu katenda giladi, kasagula vinhu vija vikoneka na wanhu wa mwiisi va kibozi ili kuwatenda wanhu weli na nzewele wagwe kinyala, na kasagula vinhu vija vikoneka na wanhu wa mwiisi vonyolila ili kuwatenda wanhu weli na nguvu wagwe kinyala. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Imulungu kasagula vinhu vija vikoneka na wanhu wa mwiisi si vinhu goya na ovibeza na hawavigesa bule ili yavinange vija vigesigwa na wanhu wa mwiisi kuwa vinoga ng'hani. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Avo kuduhu munhu yodaha kuigodela kinhu chochose mgameso ga Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Lakini Imulungu kawatenda muilumbe na Yesu Kilisito, kamtenda Kilisito yawe nzewele yetu. Kubitila heyo totendigwa tunoga mgameso ga Imulungu, na twa wanhu wa Imulungu na tokomboligwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Avo Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, “Munhu yoyose yolonda kuigoda, yaigodele kija kiyasang'hane Mndewa.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Kilisito yawambigwe mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Ndugu zangu, niye vinizile kumwenu sizile kuwapetela usenga wa Imulungu, ufisigwe kwa ulonzi mdala hebu kwa ubala wa wanhu. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Kwavija vinikalile na mweye, silondile kugesa kinhu chochose lakini Yesu Kilisito na ifa yake mumsalaba. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Avo vinizile kumwenu, ng'hala bule nguvu na nikala nodumba na kugwaya. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Mafundizo gangu na usenga wangu havilavigwe kwa mbuli zamulile kulawa kuna zinzewele za munhu, lakini kwa nguvu ya Loho wa Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>Nitenda vivo, ili kutamanila kumwenu sikukukale mna zinzewele za wanhu ila mna inguvu ya Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nzewele ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Avo, nowapetela usenga uli na nzewele kwa wanhu waja tamanilo jao dikangale. Lakini siyo nzewele za mwiisi ino hebu nguvu ya wakulu wa mwiisi ino, awo onda wabanangigwe. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Nowapetela nzewele ifisigwe ya Imulungu, yaisagule mbuli ya ukulu wetu isi ing'hali hainalumbigwa. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Kuduhu mndewa wa kipindi kino yaijuwile nzewele ino. Maza waijuwile, sambi wamuwambe mumsalaba Mndewa wa ukulu. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Lakini Maandiko golonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Mbuli zija hazinakoneka na munhu hebu kuhulikigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">mbuli hazinagesigwa mmizoyo ya wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">mbuli azo Imulungu kawekila wanhu omnogela.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Lakini Imulungu katugubulila mbuli azo kubitila Loho wake. Kwavija Loho Yang'alile kozahila kila kinhu, hata mbuli za Imulungu ziifisile ng'hani. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Kuduhu munhu yojuwa viyogesa munhu iyagwe, ila loho yake munhu ayo. Vivo ili kuduhu yajuwile mbuli za Imulungu ila Loho wa Imulungu yaiyeka. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Hatubokele bule loho wa wanhu wa isi ino, lakini tubokela Loho yatumigwe na Imulungu, ili tudahe kugajuwa gaja gose tugweleligwe na Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Avo hatulonga mbuli zifundizigwe na nzewele za wanhu, lakini kwa mbuli zifundizigwe na Loho Yang'alile, vituwafambulila mbuli za loho waja weli na Loho Yang'alile. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Munhu yoyose yeliduhu Loho Yang'alile hadaha kubokela vinhu kulawa kwa Loho wa Imulungu. Wanhu wano hawazijuwa mbuli azo, kumwao zokoneka ubozi, kwavija mbuli azo zodahika kufambuligwa kwa kutazigwa na Loho Yang'alile yaiyeka. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Munhu yoyose yeli na Loho wa Imulungu, kodaha kujuwa kila kinhu kinogile, lakini kuduhu yodaha kumtagusa. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Maandiko golonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Nani yajuwile viyogesa Mndewa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Nani yodaha kumgwaa magesa?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Lakini siye togesa viyogesa Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Wasang'hanaji wa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Ndugu zangu, kulonga ukweli, sidahile kulonga na mweye kamba vinilonga na wanhu weli na Loho wa Imulungu. Nilonda kulonga na mweye kamba wanhu wa mwiisi ino, kamba wana ving'hele waja tamanilo jao kwa Kilisito hadinakangala. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Nilondigwa kuwagwaa maziwa mung'we, lakini si ndiya mdala, kwavija hamudahile kukija. Hata sambi hamudaha bule kukija, <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>kwavija mweye mung'hali mokala kamba viwokala wanhu wa mwiisi ino. Avo moiyonela migongo na kugomba wenyego, vino, ino hailagusa kuwa mweye mung'hali wanhu wa mwiisi ino na mokala kamba viwokala wanhu wa isi ino? <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Imoja wenu kolonga, “Niye nomkweleleza Paulo,” na iyagwe kolonga, “Niye nomkweleleza Apolo,” Vino, hamutenda kamba wanhu wa mwiisi viwotenda?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Vino, Apolo ayo nani? Na Paulo ayo nani? Siye twa wasang'hanaji wa Imulungu, tuwatenda mweye mutogole. Kila imoja wetu kotenda sang'hano iyagweleligwe na Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Niye nihanda mbeyu, Apolo kagelela mazi, lakini Imulungu heyo yaitendile ikule. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Kwavija yahandile na ija yaigelele mazi wabule chochose, lakini Imulungu heyo yaitendile ikule. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Munhu yahandile na munhu yaigelele mazi wose wa kinhu kimoja, Imulungu komgweka kila imoja kwa sang'hano yake yaitendile. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Kwavija wose tosang'hana hamoja na Imulungu, mweye muwa kamba mgunda wa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Vivija mwa ng'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Kwa ng'hekewa iyangwelele Imulungu, nhenda sang'hano ya mzengaji yanogile, nika chandusilo chake na munhu iyagwe kozenga uchanha yake. Lakini kila munhu yozenga kolondigwa yateganye viyozenga. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Kuduhu munhu iyagwe iyodaha kwika chandusilo, kwavija Imulungu kamwika Yesu Kilisito yaiyeka yawe chandusilo. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Uchanha mwa chandusilo acho wanhu ozenga kwa zahabu hebu shaba hebu mabwe ganogile ng'hani, na wayagwe ozenga kwa mibiki, majani hebu usoti. <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>Ukunoga kwa sang'hano ya munhu hokoneka mna isiku ija Kilisito vondayaifisule. Kwavija mna isiku ayo moto ogubula sang'hano ya kila munhu, moto ozigeza sang'hano zao kulagusa kamba zinoga. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Kamba kija kizengigwe uchanha mwa ichandusilo chokala bila kulukula moto, mzengaji kobokela nhunza. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Lakini kamba sang'hano ya munhu yolukula, mzengaji koyagiza, lakini heyo mwenyego kokomboligwa, kamba munhu yahonyeke kulawa kuna umoto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Mweye mujuwa kuwa mwa ng'anda ya Imulungu na Loho wa Imulungu kokala mgati mmwenu! <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Avo, munhu yoyose yoibananga ng'anda ya Imulungu, Imulungu nayo kombananga munhu ayo. Kwavija ng'anda ya Imulungu ing'ala, na mweye wenyego mwa ng'anda ya Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Sikumwiivizile! Munhu yoyose kumwenu yogesa kana nzewele za mwiisi ino, muleke yawe mbozi, ili yawe na nzewele. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Kwavija nzewele za wanhu wa mwiisi ino ni ubozi mgameso ga Imulungu. Kamba Maandiko Gang'alile vigolonga, “Imulungu kowanamata weli na nzewele muubala wao,” <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>na vivija Maandiko golonga, “Mndewa kojuwa viwogesa wanhu weli na nzewele siyo chochose.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Avo, sikumuigodele wanhu, kwavija vinhu vose venu. <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>Paulo na Apolo na Kefa na isi ino na ugima na ifa na mbuli za sambi na za kumwande, gose gano genu. <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>Na mweye mwa wanhu wa Kilisito, nayo Kilisito wa Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Watumigwa wa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Mtugese siye kamba wasang'hanaji wa Kilisito, tugweleligwe udahi wa kuwafambulila wanhu mbuli zifisigwe za Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Kinhu kilondigwa kwa wanhu wose wagweleligwe sang'hano ni kutenda kamba viyolonda mkulu wao. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Niye sitonga bule nahatagusigwa na mweye, hebu munhu yoyose mwiisi, na wala sidaha kuitagusa mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Muumoyo wangu kuduhu kinhu kinitagusa niye, lakini mbuli ino hailagusa kuwa sibanange. Mndewa ayo wa kunitagusa niye. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Avo sikumumtaguse munhu yoyose king'hali kipindi hakinavika. Lekeni mbaka Mndewa vonda yeze, nayo kokwiza kugamwemwesela gaja gafisigwe mdiziza na kugafisula gaja gose geli mmizoyo ya wanhu. Aho kila munhu kobokela nhogolwa yake kulawa kwa Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Ndugu zangu, mbuli ya mweye, niye nimtenda Apolo na niye tuwe kinhu cha mweye kuifunza, avo mudahe kujuwa fambulo da ulonzi uno, “Mukweleleze vija vandikigwe.” Muladi muleke kuigodela imoja na kumbezeli iyagwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Sikuugese gweye kunoga kubanza wayagwe? Vino siyo Imulungu yakugwelele kila kinhu kiulinacho? Avo lelo koigodela choni, kamba vija vinhu viulinavo hugweleligwe bule?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Vino, mupata vose vimulonda? Mweye mwa matajili tiyali? Mweye mwa wandewa bila siye? Ona, kamba mweye kweli mwahakuwile wandewa, avo na siye twahadahile kuwa wandewa hamoja na mweye. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Kwavija vinikona niye, Imulungu katutenda siye watumigwa tuwe wanhu wa kimambukizo, kamba wanhu watagusigwe kukomigwa mgameso ga wanhu, tuwe kilozo mwiisi yose haulongozi ha wasenga wa kuulanga na wanhu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Siye twawabozi mbuli ya Kilisito, lakini mweye mwa wabala kwa kuilumba na Kilisito! Siye tunyolila, lakini mweye mugangamala! Mweye motegelezigwa lakini siye tokwehuligwa! <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Mbaka sambi siye tuna nzala na ng'hilu, tovala vikumbi, totowigwa, twabule hanhu ha kuwasa, <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>vivija todununzika na kusang'hana kwa makono getu wenyego. Twahaduwiligwa, towapulila kwa Imulungu vinhu vinogile, na twahadununzigwa tofunga umoyo, <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>twahaligigwa, tokwidika vinogile. Tokoneka kamba wanhu wafitile mwiisi, mbaka sambi siye twa dikwe da mwiisi!<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Sandika mbuli zino niwagele kinyala, lakini kuwazuma mweye kamba wanangu niwanogela. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Avo hata kamba mwahawa na vilongozi elufu kumi muugima wenu kwa Kilisito, mweye mwabule tata wengi, kwavija kwa kuilumba na Yesu Kilisito, niye na tataenu kwa kuwagalila Mbuli Inogile.<verse eid="1CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Avo, nowapula, loleni vinhendile munikweleleze. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Lekaavo nimtuma Timoseo kumwenu, mwanangu nimnogela yosang'hana kwa kumtamanila Mndewa. Nayo kowakumbusa nzila inikweleleza niye kwa kuilumba na Yesu Kilisito, nzila ija inifundiza kila hanhu mna ivibumbila va wanhu wamtogole Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Wanhu wayagwe vimwili wasonga kuigoda, kwavija ogesa niye siza kumwenu kabili. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Lakini Mndewa yahalonda, nolopola kwiza kumwenu, aho nolola mwenyego kija kiwolonga awo oigoda na nguvu iwelinayo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Kwavija Undewa wa Imulungu hauli muulonzi lakini kuna inguvu. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Mweye munogelwa na choni? Nize kumwenu na mbalati, hebu kwa unogelwa na uhole?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ugoni mna ivibumbila va wanhu wamtogole Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Avo lelo, kuna mbuli zilongigwa kamba kumwenu mweye kuna wanhu otenda ugoni, na vivija uchafu hauna koneka hata kwa wamhazi. Nilongeligwa munhu kowasa na mamake wa kuvikila! <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Modahaze kuigoda? Maza mulondigwa munyunyuwale, na munhu yatendile kilozo acho kolondigwa yawingigwe kumwenu. <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Hata kamba na kutali na mweye, lakini muumoyo wangu na hamoja na mweye, nimtagusa mwaka munhu yatendile kinhu acho kamba vija nabaho na mweye. <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>Mwahaiting'hana hamoja kwa twaga da Mndewa Yesu na niye na hamoja na mweye muumoyo wangu, na nguvu ya Mndewa wetu Yesu ya hamoja na mweye, <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>mgweleleni Mwenembago munhu ayo, ili lukuli lwake lubanangigwe, avo loho yake idahe kukomboligwa mna isiku ya Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Kuigoda kumwenu hakunogile bule! Vino hamujuwile kamba, hamila kidogo youtenda usage wose ugongomoke? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Avo isunheni, mulave hamila ya umwaka ya nzambi ili muwe bonge da sambi dilibule hamila, kamba vimulondigwa kuwa. Kwavija Yesu Kilisito ayo mwana ng'hondolo wa Pasaka yetu, kalavigwa nhosa. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Lelo tudeng'helele Pasaka yetu, siyo kwa gate dili na hamila ya umwaka ili na nzambi na ubananzi, lakini kwa gate hadigeligwe hamila, gate dinogile na ukweli.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Nimwandikileni mna ibaluwa yangu iyagwe, mwiinege na wanhu weli wagoni. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Silonga mwiinege na wanhu hawamtogola Imulungu weli wagoni hebu wagila hebu wabavi hebu waja otambikila vinyago. Kwavija mwahalonda kuinega nao wose, molondigwa kulawanya mwiisi ino. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Fambulo da mbuli zinyandike ijo dino, mwiinege na munhu yoyose yoikema Mkilisito kuno kotenda ugoni hebu mgila hebu kovitambikila vinyago hebu muligaji hebu kokoligwa hebu mbavi. Hata kuja sikumuje nayo munhu ayo.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Lekaavo, silondigwa kuwatagusa wanhu weli kunze ya vibumbila va wanhu wamtogole Yesu. Vino mweye hamulondigwa kuwatagusa wanhu weli mna ivibumbila venu? <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Imulungu kowatagusa wanhu weli kunze ya vibumbila va wanhu wamtogole Yesu. Mweye muwingeni munhu yehile mkibumbila chenu.<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kitala cha Wakilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Vino, kamba imoja wenu kana kitala na Mkilisito miyage, yokuwaze komgala mkitala cha wanhu hawamtogole Yesu, koleka kumgala kwa wanhu wa Imulungu? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Vino, hamujuwile bule wanhu wa Imulungu okwiza kuwatagusa wanhu wa mwiisi? Kamba wanhu wa mwiisi otagusigwa na mweye, vino molemelwa kutagusa mbuli ndodo ndodo? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Vino, mweye hamujuwile tokwiza kuwatagusa wasenga wa kuulanga? Todaha ng'hani kutagusa vinhu va ugima uno! <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Kamba mwahagomba, vino mowakema wanhu hawategelezigwa mkibumbila chenu cha wanhu wamtogole Yesu wawe wasemi? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Mogela kinyala! Vino kuduhu hata munhu imoja kumwenu yeli na nzewele yodaha kuwazuma Wakilisito wagombile? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Lakini Mkilisito komgala Mkilisito miyage mkitala, kwa wasemi hawamtogole Yesu!<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Kulonga ukweli, kuigala kwenu mkitala mweye kwa mweye kolagusa kama muhumwa. Vinoga mweye koneligwa. Vinoga mweye kuviziligwa na kubokigwa vinhu venu. <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Lakini mweye wao muwonela na kuwaboka ndugu zenu vinhu vao kwa uvizi! <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Vino, hamujuwile kamba wanhu otenda gehile honda waupate Undewa wa Imulungu? Sikumwiivizile, wanhu okala kwa ugima wa ugoni ubanzile hebu ovitambikila vinyago hebu otenda ugoni hebu wambigalo ohindusa wayao, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>hebu wabavi hebu wagila hebu okoligwa hebu kuwaliga wayao hebu wabokaji, wao wose kuduhu yonda yaupate Undewa wa Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Wanhu wayagwe kumwenu mukala vivo. Lakini sambi nzambi zenu zisegesigwa, mulavigwa kwa Imulungu, mutendigwa munoga mgameso ga Imulungu kwa twaga da Mndewa Yesu Kilisito na Loho wa Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hanileni ng'huli zenu kwa ukulu wa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>Munhu kodaha kulonga, “Vinhu vose nodaha kutenda.” Lakini siyo vinhu vose vinoga kumwangu. Notogola nodaha kutenda kinhu chochose, lakini sitogola kinhu chochose kinhende niwe mtumwa wake. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>Munhu iyagwe kolonga, “Ndiya kwa mbuli ya inda, na inda kwa mbuli ya ndiya.” Ona, lakini Imulungu kovibananga vose vibili. Lukuli lwa munhu siyo kwa mbuli ya ugoni, lakini kwa mbuli ya kumsang'hanila Mndewa, nayo mndewa ayo yowika goya lukuli. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Imulungu kamzilibula Mndewa Yesu kwa wanhu wafile, na siye vivija kotuzilibula kwa nguvu zake.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Vino, hamujuwile kuwa ng'huli zenu ni maungo ga lukuli lwa Kilisito? Hebu mogesa nodaha kusola maungo ga lukuli lwa Kilisito na kugatenda gawe maungo ga ulukuli lwa munhu yosulukila ugoni? Aka! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Hebu hamujuwile bule munhu yonda yailumbe na munhu yosulukila ugoni kokuwa lukuli lumoja na munhu ayo? Kwavija yandikigwa mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile, “Weli wabili okuwa lukuli lumoja.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Lakini munhu ija yoilumba na Mndewa kahamoja nayo kiloho.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Avo muinege ng'hani na ugoni. Kwavija nzambi ziyagwe zitendigwa na munhu haziubananga lukuli, lakini munhu yotenda ugoni kolutendela nzambi lukuli lwake mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Vino, hamujuwile bule ng'huli zenu ayo ng'anda ya Loho Yang'alile, yeli mgati mmwenu imugweleligwe na Imulungu? Avo lelo, mweye siyo kinhu chenu wenyego, lakini cha Imulungu, <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>kwavija muguligwa kwa bei ng'hulu. Avo zisang'hanileni ng'huli zenu kwa ukulu wa Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kusola na kusoligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Lelo, kwa mbuli zija zimnyandikile,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">“Mbigalo kotenda goya yahaleka kusola mtwanzi.” <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Lakini kwavija kuna ugoni, kila mbigalo yawe na mwehe wake mwenyego, na kila mtwanzi yawe na mkasano wake mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Mbigalo yatende vija viyolondigwa kwa mwehe wake na vivija mtwanzi yatende vija viyolondigwa kwa mkasano wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Mwehe kabule udahi na lukuli lwake, lakini mkasano wake kanao. Vivo ili kwa mkasano kaduhu udahi na lukuli lwake, lakini mwehe wake kanao. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Sikumuleke kuwasa hamoja lakini vonda muitogolele wenyego kutenda vivo ili mupate kipindi kinogile cha kumpula Imulungu. Abaho ibweleleni kabili, ili Mwenembago sikuyawageze kwavija hamudaha kuitawala wenyego.<verse eid="1CO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Siwalongela vino kwa kuwalagiza, lakini vinigesa niye. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Maza vinonda niye wanhu wose wakale kamba vinili niye, lakini kila munhu kana nhunza yake kulawa kwa Imulungu. Imoja kana nhunza ino, na iyagwe kana nhunza ija.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Lelo, kwa waja hawanasola na weli wagane, vinoga kumwenu kukala usaka kamba vinili niye. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Lakini mwahalemelwa kukala usaka, soleni, kwavija vinoga kusola kubanza kusulukila watwanzi.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Kwa waja wasolile na kusoligwa nowagwaa lagizo, sijangu lakini da Mndewa, mwehe sikuyaileke na mkasano wake, <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>lakini kamba yahatenda vivo, yakale usaka hebu wailumbe kabili na mkasano wake. Nayo mkasano sikuyamwase mwehe wake.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Kwa wanhu wayagwe nolonga niye, lakini siyo Mndewa, kamba mbigalo Mkilisito kana mwehe yolema kumtogola Yesu na imwehe kotogola kukala nayo, sikuyamwase. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Na kamba mtwanzi Mkilisito kasoligwa na mbigalo hamtogola Yesu na kotogola kukala nayo, sikuyamuleme. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Kwavija mkasano hamtogola Yesu kotogoligwa na Imulungu kwa kuilumba na mwehe wake, na mwehe hamtogola Yesu kotogoligwa na Imulungu kwa kuilumba na mkasano wake. Maza haili vivo, wana wao sambi watogoligwe na Imulungu, lakini Imulungu kawatogola. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Lakini kamba ija hamtogola Yesu kolonda kumuleka miyage yeli Mkilisito na yamuleke. Kwa kilamuso acho, ayo imkilisito, mbigalo hebu mtwanzi, hagomigwa kutenda vivo. Kwavija Imulungu kawakema mukale moyo uholile. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Gweye mwehe Mkilisito, kojuwa vilihi kuwa hudaha kumkombola mkasano wako? Hebu gweye mkasano Mkilisito, kojuwa vilihi kuwa hudaha kumkombola mwehe wako?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukale kamba Imulungu viyakukemile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Avo kila munhu na yakale kamba vija Mndewa viyamtendile yawe, na vivija ukale kamba viukalile Imulungu viyakukemile. Dino dijo lagizo jangu kwa vibumbila vose va wanhu wamtogole Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Kamba munhu yengile kumbi kakemigwa na Imulungu, sikuyaivizile kuwa hanakwingila kumbi. Na kamba viyakemigwe kakala hanakwingila kumbi, sikuyengile kumbi. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Kwavija kwingila kumbi hebu kuleka kwingila kumbi siyo kinhu, kilondigwa ni kugagoga malagizo ga Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Avo kila munhu yakale kamba viyakalile kipindi viyakemigwe na Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Vino, gweye viukemigwe na Imulungu kukala mtumwa? Sikuugelegeze, lakini wahapata kipindi cha kulekesigwa, kisang'hanile. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Kwavija mtumwa yakemigwe na Mndewa kokuwa munhu yalekesigwe kwa Mndewa. Vivo ili kwa munhu yalekesigwe yakemigwe na Mndewa kokuwa mtumwa wa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Imulungu kawagula kwa bei ng'hulu, avo sikumuwe watumwa wa wanhu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Ndugu zangu, kila munhu na yakale kwa kuilumba na Imulungu kamba vija viyakalile kipindi Imulungu viyamkemile.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya wanhu wasaka na wagane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Kwa gaja gamtwandikile mbuli ya wanhu wasaka, nabule lagizo kulawa kwa Mndewa, lakini nolonga vinigesa kamba munhu nitamaniligwa mbuli ya koneligwa bazi na Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Lakini mbuli ya kugaya kuli sambi, vinikona niye yokuwa vinoga kwa munhu kukala kamba viyali. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Vino gweye kuna mwehe? Avo sikuumwase. Vino gweye hunasola? Avo sikuulonde kusola. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Lakini wahasola, hutendile nzambi. Na mndele yahasoligwa hatendile nzambi. Lakini wao waisolile ogazika ng'hani mwiisi ino, na niye silonda mweye muwe kamba wao.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Ndugu zangu, nolonga vino, kipindi kisigale kidodo. Avo kulawa sambi wanhu weli na wehe wakale kamba wasaka, <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>na waja olila wakale kamba hawalila na waja odeng'helela wakale kamba hawadeng'helela na wagulaji wakale kamba hawagulile kinhu, <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>na waja osang'hanila vinhu va mwiisi ino wakale kamba wabule sang'hano navo. Kwavija isi ino kamba viili sambi, honda ikale ng'hani.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Nolonda mweye sikumunyawenyawe. Munhu msaka kohunganikila mbuli za Mndewa, kwavija kolonda kumnogeza Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Lakini mbigalo mwene mwehe kohunganikila mbuli za mwiisi, kwavija kolonda kumnogeza mwehe wake, <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>nayo kokwegigwa mhande mbili. Mtwanzi yelibule mkasano hebu mhambe kohunganikila sang'hano za Mndewa, kwavija kolonda kung'ala kwa lukuli na loho, lakini mtwanzi yeli na mkasano kohunganikila mbuli za mwiisi, kwavija kolonda kumnogeza mkasano wake.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Nolonga vino kwavija nolonda kuwataza mweye. Siwagoma bule, lakini nolonda mweye mutende gaja ganogile ili mupate kumsang'hanila Mndewa kwa moyo umoja.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Kamba munhu yoyose kogesa hamtendela vinogile mhambe yoolonda kufunga nayo zengele. Na kamba mhambe ayo kokuwa na miyaka mingi kwa kusoligwa na komsulukila ng'hani na yatende kamba viyolonda. Yafunge nayo zengele, aho hatenda nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Lakini kamba mbigalo kolonda mwenyego muumoyo wake kuleka kusola, na kodaha kuleka kusulukila na kutenda viyolonda, aho kotenda goya ng'hani yahaleka kumsola mhambe ayo. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Avo munhu yosola mtwanzi kotenda vinogile, lakini munhu yoleka kusola kotenda vinogile ng'hani.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Mtwanzi yasoligwe kokuwa kafungigwa na mkasano wake kipindi chose cha ugima wake, lakini mkasano wake yahafa, kodaha kusoligwa na mbigalo yoyose yoomulonda lakini kolondigwa yawe Mkilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Lakini vinikona niye, mtwanzi ayo komweda ng'hani yahakala usaka. Avo vinigesa niye, vivija ninayo Loho wa Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya ndiya ilavigwe nhosa kwa vinyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Sambi, kwa mbuli ya ndiya ilavigwe nhosa kwa vinyago va imilungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Tojuwa, wose tuna ubala, na ubala awo omtenda munhu yaigode, lakini unogelwa ozenga. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Waja ogesa ojuwa kinhu, hawajuwa kamba viwolondigwa kujuwa. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Lakini munhu yomnogela Imulungu, kojuwigwa na Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Avo mbuli ya kuja ndiya ilavigwe nhosa kwa vinyago va imilungu, tojuwa vinyago siyo kinhu chochose mwiisi, tojuwa Imulungu imoja yaiyeka. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Hata yahawa kuna vinhu vikemigwa, “walungu”, mwiisi hebu kuulanga. Ona, hata kamba wanhu olonga kuna vinhu vikemigwa, “walungu” na “wandewa,” <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>lakini kumwetu siye tuna Imulungu imoja yaiyeka, Tata ija yaumbile vinhu vose na kubitila heyo tokuwa wagima. Na kuna Mndewa imoja yaiyeka, nayo ayo Yesu Kilisito, kubitila heyo vinhu vose vilumbigwa, na siye twawagima kubitila heyo.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Lakini siyo kila munhu kana ubala uno. Wanhu wayagwe wakala wazowele kuvitambikila vinyago, mbaka sambi wahakala kuna ukuja ogesa woja ndiya ilavigwe nhosa kwa vinyago va imilungu, kwavija mizoyo yao yonyolila, na yofitizigwa. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Lakini ndiya haidaha bule kutugala behi na Imulungu. Avo twahaleka kuja hatuhungukilwa kinhu, na twahaja hatukongezelwa kinhu.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Lakini muiteganye, kulekesigwa kwenu sikukuwatende waja weli na mizoyo inyolile watende nzambi. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Kamba munhu moyo wake unyolila, yahakona gweye uli na kija kiukema ubala, koja mna ing'anda ya kulavila nhosa kwa vinyago va imilungu, vino hageligwa moyo kuja ndiya ilavigwe nhosa kwa vinyago va imilungu? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Avo mkilisito miyago yeli na moyo unyolile, ija Kilisito yafile mbuli yake, kopotela mbuli ya kija kiukema ubala wako! <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Kwavija mowatendela nzambi wakilisito waenu na kuilumiza mizoyo yao inyolile, momtendela nzambi Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Avo kamba ndiya yomuhonza mkilisito miyangu yatende nzambi, sija nyama ng'o, ili sikunimuhonze mkilisito miyangu yatende nzambi.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano za watumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Vino, niye silekesigwe bule? Vino, niye sili mtumigwa bule? Vino, niye simonile bule Mndewa wetu Yesu? Vino mweye siyo ulawililo wa sang'hano yangu kwa Mndewa? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Hata kamba wanhu wayagwe hawatogola kuwa niye na mtumigwa, lakini kumwenu mweye na mtumigwa! Mweye awo kilaguso cha utumigwa wangu, kwavija muilumba na Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Munhu yoyose yononga vihile, vino vivo vonda niigombele. <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>Vino, silondigwa kuja na kung'wa kwa sang'hano yangu? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Vino, silondigwa kukweleleza viwotenda watumigwa wayagwe na Kefa na ndugu zake Mndewa, kwa kumsola mwehe Mkilisito mna imiyanza yetu? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Hebu niye niiyeka na Balinaba wao tulondigwa kusang'hana ili tupate gaja gatulondigwa? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Vino, mkalizi gani yoiliha mwenyego kwa sang'hano yake? Vino, mulimaji gani yoleka kuja matunda ga mgunda? Vino, msusilaji gani yoleka kung'wa maziwa ga fugo yake?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Silonga ulonzi uno kwa udahi wa kiunhu, kwavija Malagizo ga Musa golonga vivo. <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Yandikigwa mna Gamalagizo ga Musa, “Sikuumfunge ng'ombe umulomo wahamsang'hanila kuhulula uhemba.” Vino lelo, tulonge Imulungu kosang'hanila ng'ombe? <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Vino, hakalile kotugesa siye viyalongile avo? Ona, gano gandikigwa mbuli ya siye, kwavija mulimaji na msengaji wose otamanila kuigolela kija kisengigwe. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Siye tuhanda mbeyu ya Loho mgati mwenu. Vino mbuli ng'hulu twahapata vinhu vitulondigwa? <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Kamba wayagwe olondigwa kupata vinhu avo kwa kutamanila kulawa kumwenu, vino siye hatulondigwa kupata ng'hani kubanza wao?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Siye hatukisang'hanila kitulondigwa kupata. Lakini, tofunga umoyo kwa kila kinhu ili sikutuikimile Mbuli Inogile ya Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Vino hamujuwile kuwa waja osang'hana Mng'anda ya Imulungu, opata ndiya yao kulawa mumo, na waja olava nhosa muupango opata fungu kulawa mwiinhosa ayo? <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Vivo ili kwa Mndewa, kalagiza waja opeta Mbuli Inogile wapate ndiya yao kulawa mumo.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Lakini niye sisang'hanile hata dimoja dinilondigwa kupata, na wala sikwandika ili mhate zinondigwa kupata. Kumwangu niye nokona vinoga kufa, kubanza munhu yoyose yanyone noigoda kwa mulomo wiiyeka! <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Lakini nopeta Mbuli Inogile, siyo mbuli ya kuigoda kwa mulomo. Ino ayo sang'hano inigweleligwe. Nojona nahaleka kuwapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile! <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Maza niisagule sang'hano ino kwa kulonda mwenyego, nahatamanile fungu, lakini noisang'hana siyo kwa kulonda niye kwavija Imulungu ayo yanisagule nimsang'hanile. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Vino, nopata fungu gani? Fungu jangu ni kuwapetela Mbuli Inogile bila kupula sente, bila kupula kinondeka kupata kwa kuwapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Niye sili mtumwa wa munhu yoyose bule, lakini niitenda mwenyego mtumwa wa kila munhu, ili mhate wanhu bwando wamtogole Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Vinikalile nosang'hana na Wayahudi ng'hala kamba Muyahudi ili niwapate Wayahudi, hamoja niye silongozigwa na Malagizo ga Musa, lakini ng'hala kamba viwakalile wao ili niwapate waja olongozigwa na Malagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Vivo ili, vinisang'hane kwa waja welilbule Malagizo ga Musa, ng'hala kamba viwokala wao, ili niwapate waja welibule Malagizo ga Musa. Ino hainhenda sikunilongozigwe na Malagizo ga Imulungu, lakini nolongozigwa na Malagizo ga Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Kwa waja wanyolile, na niye ninyolila ili niwapate hewo. Avo niitenda kila kinhu kwa wanhu wose ili nidahe kuwatenda wayagwe wakomboligwe kwa nzila yoyose idahika.<verse eid="1CO 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Notenda gano gose kwa mbuli ya Mbuli Inogile ili mhate fungu mna ivinhu vake vinogile. <verse eid="1CO 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Vino, hamujuwile bule kuna ulubuga lwa kukimbilila wanhu bwando okimbila, lakini ija yonda yahume kobokela fungu? Avo kolondigwa ukimbile ili ubokele fungu. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Kila mkimbilaji kowamba kuitanda goya ili yapate taji dibanangika, lakini siye totenda avo tupate taji dileka kubanangika. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Lekaavo, nowamba kukimbila nidahe kuvika kuuhelelo, niye niigala na munhu yoitowa, yoleka kwagiza ng'honde zake. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Lekaavo, nolugangamiza lukuli lwangu ili nilutawale ludahe kusang'hana ili sikunyoneke sifaya nahamambukiza kuwapetela wayagwe.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu ozumigwa mbuli ya vinyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Ndugu zangu, nolonda mujuwe kilawilile kwa wahenga zetu wamkweleleze Musa. Wose wakala okalizigwa hasi ya wingu, na wose wabita goya kuna Ibahali. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Wose wabatizigwa mdiwingu na mna ibahali kamba wanahina wa Musa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Wose waja gate didija da kiloho. <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>Vivija wang'wa kinhu kikija cha kiloho. Wang'wa kulawa mdibwe dija da kiloho diwacholile najo, dibwe dijo dikala Yesu Kilisito mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Lakini wanhu bwando hawamnogeze Imulungu, na mitufi yao ipwililika kuluwala.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Lelo, mbuli zose zino ziwe kinhu cha kuifunzila, kutuzuma siye sikutusulukile gehile, kamba viwatendile wao. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>Vivija sikutuvitambikile vinyago, kamba viwatendile wayagwe. Kamba Maandiko vigolonga, “Wanhu waja na kung'wa, wafeng'hula kwa ugoni.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Sikututende ugoni kamba viwatendile wayagwe, siku dimoja wafa wanhu elufu ishilini na ndatu. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Sikutumgeze Kilisito, kamba viwatendile wayagwe, na wakomigwa na mizoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Sikutuiyalale kamba viwatendile wayagwe, na wakomigwa na msenga wa ifa wa kuulanga.<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Mbuli zose azo ziwalawilila wao, iwe kilaguso kwa wayagwe na zandikigwa kutuzuma siye. Kwavija tokala mna ikipindi cha mmabehi na uhelelo wa isi.<verse eid="1CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Avo munhu yoigesa kema goya yaiteganye sikuyagwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Kugezigwa kwenu siyo kilozo kwa wanhu. Lakini Imulungu kotenda kiyalongile, na honda yatogole mugezigwe kubanza nguvu zenu. Hamoja mogezigwa, lakini kowagwaa nguvu ya kugangamala na kowagwaa nzila ya kulawila.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Avo, mbwiga zangu niwanogela, mwiinege na mbuli ya kuvitambikila vinyago. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Nolonga na mweye wanhu muli na nzewele, gelegezeni wenyego gano gonilonga. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Twahamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu na kung'wa divai mkikasi, toilumba na damu ya Kilisito. Twahabanzula gate na kudija toilumba na lukuli lwa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Hamoja siye twa wanhu bwando twa lukuli lumoja, kwavija kuna gate dimoja, wose toigolela gate dijo.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Waloleni wanhu wa Izilaeli, awo wajaga ndiya ya nhosa ilavigwe muupango, oilumba na nhosa ilavigwe kwa Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Avo lelo, nonge choni? Vino, vinyago va imilungu hebu ndiya ilavigwe nhosa kwa vinyago vofaya choni? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Aka! Kinilonga niye ni kija kilavigwe nhosa muupango wa wamhazi, siyo kwa Imulungu. Na niye silonda mweye muilumbe na vinyamkela. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Hamudaha kung'wela kikasi cha Mndewa na vivija kung'wela kikasi cha vinyamkela, hamudaha kuja ndiya lwa Mndewa na kuja ndiya ya vinyamkela. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Hebu tolonda kumgeza Mndewa yone migongo? Vino siye tuna nguvu kubanza heyo?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>Mweye molonga, “Vinhu vose todaha kutenda,” lakini niye nolonga siyo vinhu vose vinoga. Mweye molonga, “Vinhu vose todaha kutenda,” lakini niye nolonga siyo vinhu vose vozenga. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Munhu yoyose kumwenu sikuyaigese mwenyego yaiyeka, lakini yawagese wanhu wayagwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Diyeni chochose kiuzigwa kudigulilo, bila kuuza uza na kuitenda mizoyo nyunguwaa. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Kwavija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, “Isi na vose vili mumo ni vinhu va Mndewa.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Kamba munhu hamtogola Yesu kowagoneka kuja na mweye motogola kuchola, diyeni chochose chonda yawatandileni, sikumuuze uze mmizoyo yenu. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Lakini kamba munhu kowalongela, “Ndiya ino ilavigwa nhosa kwa vinyago va imilungu,” kwa mbuli ya ayo yawalongele na kwa mbuli ya mizoyo, sikumuje. <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Nolonga vino, siyo mbuli ya mizoyo yenu, lakini mbuli ya moyo wa ayo yawalongele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Munhu kodaha kulonga, “Habali kulekesigwa kwangu kutamanile moyo wa munhu iyagwe? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Kamba noja kuno nomgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu mbuli ya ndiya lwangu, habali munhu yanonge vihile mbuli ya ndiya inimgwelele nhogolwa Imulungu?”<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Avo chochose kimutenda, iwe kuja hebu kung'wa, gose tendeni mbuli ya ukulu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Sikumuwe ng'hwalo kwa Wayahudi hebu kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi hebu kwa wanhu wose wa Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Muwe kamba niye, nogeza kuwanogeza wose kwa kila nzila, sitenda gaja gonyona kumwangu ganoga, lakini notenda gaja gowokona wayagwe wose ganoga, avo wadahe kukomboligwa.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Loleni vinhendile munikweleleze, kamba vija niye vinilolile viyatendile Kilisito na kumkweleleza.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugubika pala kipindi cha kumtambikila Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Nowagwaa nhogolwa kwa kung'humbuka niye kwa kila kinhu na kugagoga mafundizo ganiwagwee. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Lakini nolonda mujuwe kuwa Kilisito ayo pala kwa kila munhu, na mkasano ayo pala kwa mwehe wake, na Imulungu ayo pala kwa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Avo kila mbigalo yompula Imulungu, hebu yolonga usenga wa Imulungu kuno kagubika pala jake, ayo kombeza Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Mtwanzi yoyose yompula Imulungu hebu kulonga usenga wa Imulungu bila kugubika pala jake, ayo komgela kinyala mkasano wake. Mtwanzi yotenda avo kaigala na mtwanzi yabeiye pala jake. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Mtwanzi yoleka kugubika pala jake, vivija yabee mvili zake. Kwavija yogela kinyala kwa mtwanzi kusenya mvili zake hebu kubea, kolondigwa yagubike pala jake. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Mbigalo halondigwa kugubika pala jake, kwavija heyo ayo sisila na ukulu wa Imulungu. Lakini mtwanzi ayo ukulu wa mbigalo. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Kwavija mbigalo haumbigwe kulawa kwa mtwanzi, lakini mtwanzi kalumbigwa kulawa kwa mbigalo. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Vivija mbigalo haumbigwe mbuli ya mtwanzi, lakini mtwanzi kalumbigwa mbuli ya mbigalo. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Kwa mbuli ayo na mbuli ya wasenga wa kuulanga, lekaavo mtwanzi kogubika pala jake iwe kilaguso cha kulongozigwa na mbigalo wake. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Lakini kwa kuilumba na Mndewa mtwanzi siyo kinhu bila mbigalo, na mbigalo siyo kinhu bila ya mtwanzi. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Kamba vija mtwanzi viyalawile kwa mbigalo, vivo ili mbigalo kovumbuka kulawa kwa mtwanzi, lakini vinhu vose volawa kwa Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Gelegezeni wenyego, kamba vinoga kwa mtwanzi kumpula Imulungu bila kugubika pala jake. <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Hata Imulungu viyaumbile kolagusa kuwa mbigalo yahawa na mvili nhali koigela kinyala mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>Lakini kwa mtwanzi kuwa na mvili nhali yolagusa unovu wake, kwavija kagweleligwa mvili nhali zimgubike. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Kamba munhu yoyose kolonda kuibamila kwa mbuli ayo, siye twabule mila iyagwe, vivija kwa vibumbila va wanhu wamtogole Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndiya ya kukumbuka ifa ya Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Matayo 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maluko 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Mna gamalagizo gano, siwagwaa bule nhogolwa, kwavija miting'hano yenu ya kumtambikila Imulungu yogala gehile kubanza ganogile. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Aho haichanduso, mhulika kuwa mwahaiting'hana hamoja moigola mna ivibumbila, na niye notogola kidogo. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Ona molondigwa muigole, ili waja wemile mna uukweli oneke goya. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Avo mwahaiting'hana mogesa moja ndiya ya Mndewa kumbe haili vivo bule. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Kwavija mna ukuja, kila imoja kolongola kusola ndiya yake mwenyego, kuno wayagwe wana nzala na wayagwe wakoligwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Vino, mweye mwabule kae za kudila na kung'wela? Hebu mowazeha kibumbila cha wanhu wamtogole Imulungu na kuwagela kinyala wanhu weliduhu kinhu? Vino niwalongele choni? Niwagwee nhogolwa? Siwagwaa nhogolwa kwa mbuli ayo!<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Kwavija nibokela mafundizo kulawa kwa Mndewa niwagwee mweye. Kilo kija Mndewa Yesu viyahindukigwe, kasola gate, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kadibanzula na kalonga, “Uno awo lukuli lwangu, umugweleligwe, mutende vivo kwa kung'humbuka niye.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Vivija, viyamambukize kuja kasola kikasi cha divai, kalonga, “Kikasi kino ni lagano da sambi da Imulungu, mwiidamu yangu, kokose konda mung'we, ing'weni kwa kung'humbuka niye.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Kwavija mwahaja gate dino na kung'wela kikasi kino cha divai, mowapetela wanhu ifa ya Mndewa mbaka vonda yeze kabili. <verse eid="1CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Avo munhu yoyose yoja gate da Mndewa hebu kung'wela vihile kikasi acho cha divai, munhu ayo kotagusigwa kwa kulutendela vihile lukuli na damu ya Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Avo kila munhu tanhu yailolese mwenyego, yang'hali hanakuja gate na kung'wela kikasi acho. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yoja na kung'wa bila kujuwa fambulo da lukuli lwa Mndewa, munhu ayo koja na kung'wa nhaguso yake mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Lekaavo, wanhu bwando kumwenu wanyolila na watamu, na wanhu bwando wafa. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Maza tusongile kuilolesa goya wenyego, sambi tutagusigwe na Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Lakini totagusigwa na kufunzigwa na Mndewa, ili sikutoneke tubananga hamoja na wanhu wa mwiisi.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Avo ndugu zangu, mwahaiting'hana hamoja kuja ndiya ya Mndewa, kila munhu yambete miyage. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Na kamba hana munhu yoyose kana nzala na yaje ukae kumwake, ili kuiting'hana kwenu sikukuwatende mutagusigwe na Imulungu. Lakini kwa mbuli zija ziyagwe, nowapetela vondanize.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Nhunza zilawa kwa Loho Yang'alile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Sambi ndugu zangu, kwa mbuli ya nhunza zitugweleligwe na Loho Yang'alile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:1">Nolonda mujuwe vinogile mbuli azo. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Mojuwa kamba vimukalile mung'hali hamunamjuwa Imulungu, mulongozigwa na kutawaligwa na mbuli za kuvitambikila vinyago vilibule ugima. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Nolonda mujuwe kuwa, kuduhu munhu yoyose yolongozigwa na Loho wa Imulungu yodaha kulonga, “Yesu yaduwiligwe,” na kuduhu munhu yodaha kulonga, “Yesu ayo Mndewa,” bila kulongozigwa na Loho Yang'alile.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Kuna nhunza nyingi, lakini Loho yolava nhunza zizo imoja. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Kuna nzila nyingi za kusang'hana, lakini Mndewa yosang'haniligwa imoja. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Kuna nzila nyingi za kusang'hana, lakini Imulungu ayo yowagwaa wanhu wose udahi wa kusang'hana. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Loho Yang'alile koilagusa kwa kila munhu kwa nzila nyingi ili wanhu wose wamwede. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Loho komgwaa munhu usenga uli na nzewele, na kwa munhu iyagwe Loho iija komgwaa udahi wa kujuwa mbuli. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Loho iija komgwaa munhu imoja tamanilo, na komgwaa iyagwe udahi wa kuhonya wanhu. <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Loho Yang'alile komgwaa munhu udahi wa kutenda unzonza, iyagwe komgwaa nhunza ya kulonga usenga wa Imulungu, na iyagwe komgwaa nhunza ya kujuwa nhunza zilawa kwa Loho hebu hazilawa kwa Loho. Vivija Loho komgwaa munhu nhunza ya kulonga ulonzi wa sambi, na iyagwe nhunza ya kuzifambula. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Gano gose gotendigwa na Loho ayo imoja, komgwaa kila munhu nhunza yake kamba viyolonda Loho.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lukuli lumoja, maungo mengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Kamba vija lukuli lumoja viwili na maungo mengi, hata kamba maungo gago mengi, lakini gotenda lukuli lumoja, vivija vivo ili kwa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Vivo ili kumwetu siye wose, tuwe Wayahudi hebu haweli Wayahudi, watumwa hebu wanhu walekesigwe, wose tubatizigwa kwa Loho imoja mulukuli lumoja na wose tugweleligwa Loho imoja tumng'we.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Kwavija lukuli haluumbigwe kwa kiungo kimoja kiiyeka, lakini kwa maungo mengi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Maza mgulu wahalongile, “Kwavija niye sili mkono bule, sili kiungo cha lukuli,” vino sambi uwe kiungo cha lukuli? Aka! <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Na gwiti dahalongile, “Kwavija niye sili siso bule, niye sili lukuli bule,” vino, sambi diwe kiungo cha lukuli? Aka! <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Maza lukuli lose lwahawile siso, munhu yahadahile vilihi kuhulika? Na maza lukuli lose lwahakalile gwiti diiyeka, munhu yahadahile vilihi kunusa? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Avo Imulungu kakika kila kiungo mulukuli kamba viyalondile. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Maza lukuli lose lwahawile kiungo kimoja, sambi kuwe na lukuli! <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Vivo ili, maungo mengi, lakini lukuli lumoja.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Avo, siso hadidaha kuulongela mkono, “Sikulonda gweye!” hebu pala hadidaha kugalongela magulu, “Siwalonda mweye!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Lakini viikoneka, hatudaha kutenda kinhu bila maungo ga lukuli gokoneka ganyolila. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Na maungo gotugesa hagafaya ng'hani, gago maungo gololesigwa goya, kuno maungo gogela kinyala gogubikigwa goya. <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>Lakini maungo gotugesa todaha kugalagusa hatugatonga. Avo Imulungu ayo yawikile lukuli hamoja, kakigwaa kutegelezigwa ng'hani kiungo kija kihungukiligwe kutegelezigwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>Avo, kuduhu kuigola mulukuli, lakini maungo gose goitaza. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Kamba kiungo kimoja chahalumila, maungo gose gayagwe golumila hamoja nacho na kamba kiungo kimoja chahatogoligwa, maungo gose gayagwe godeng'helela hamoja nacho.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Avo, mweye mose mwa lukuli lwa Kilisito, kila munhu kiungo cha lukuli lulo. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Mvibumbila va wanhu wamtogole Yesu Imulungu kaweka, mosi watumigwa, pili watula ndagu na kadatu wafundiza, abaho kaweka waja weli na nhunza ya kutenda unzonza, abaho waja weli na nhunza ya kuhonya hebu kuwataza wayagwe hebu udahi wa kuwalongoza wanhu hebu kulonga ulonzi wa sambi. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Wanhu wose siyo watumigwa hebu watula ndagu hebu wafundiza. Siyo kila munhu kana udahi wa kutenda unzonza, <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>hebu kuhonya watamu hebu kulonga ulonzi wa sambi hebu kufambula ulonzi. <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Avo, sulukileni nhunza zili ng'hulu ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Na niye nowalagusila nzila inogile ng'hani.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Unogelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Hata nahadaha kulonga ulonzi wa wanhu na hata wa wasenga wa kuulanga, lakini kamba nabule unogelwa, ulonzi wangu nyangi ziiyeka kamba munhu yotowa mpatu kuna dizengele hebu nyangili. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Vivija nodaha kuwa na nhunza ya kupeta usenga wa Imulungu, nozijuwa mbuli zose zifisigwe, na nodaha kuwa na tamanilo da kuhamiza vigongo, lakini nahaswela unogelwa niye siyo kinhu. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Nodaha kulava vinhu vangu vose kuwagwaa wakiwa, hata kuulava lukuli lwangu lulukuzigwe, lakini nahaswela unogelwa hainifaya chochose.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Yeli na unogelwa kobetela kwa kufunga umoyo, muhole, kabule migongo hebu kuitapa hebu kuigoda. <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Yeli na unogelwa kotegeleza, haigesa mwenyego bule, hebu kugevuzika himahima, kabule mfundo. <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Yeli na unogelwa hadeng'helela gehile, lakini kodeng'helela ukweli. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Yeli na unogelwa habwela kuchugu, kotamaniligwa na kotamanila gose na kogangamala.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Unogelwa haulemelwa. Kamba kuna nhunza za kupeta usenga wa Imulungu, zose zobita siku dimoja, yahawa nhunza ya kulonga ulonzi wa sambi, yohuhwa, wahawa ubala nao obita. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Kwavija ubala wetu na nhunza yetu ya kupeta mbuli ya Imulungu hawenele, <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>lakini kipindi chahavika Imulungu kotenda chenele kija kihunguke na hachenele cholawanya.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Ving'halile mwana, nilonga na nigelegeza na nigesa kamba mwana, lakini sambi na mkulu, mbuli zose za uwana nizileka. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Kitona sambi kamba lumvuye mvuye mna ikiyoo, lakini aho kumwande tokona meso kwa meso. Sambi nojuwa hadodo, aho kumwande nojuwa goya, kamba vija Imulungu viyanjuwile niye.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Vinhu vino vidatu vosigala, kutogola, kutamanila na unogelwa, lakini dili kulu kubanza gose awo unogelwa.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s">Nhunza ziyagwe zilawa kwa Loho Yang'alile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Uzahileni unogelwa. Vivija zahileni nhunza ziyagwe zilawa kwa Loho Yang'alile, ng'hani ng'hani nhunza ya kuwapetela wanhu usenga wa Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Munhu yolonga kwa ulonzi ukanganya, halonga na wanhu lakini kolonga na Imulungu, kwavija kuduhu munhu yojuwa. Kolonga mbuli ziifisile kwa udahi wa Loho. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Lakini waja owapetela wanhu usenga wa Imulungu, olonga na wanhu mbuli ya kuwagela moyo, kuwagangamiza na kuwahoza mizoyo. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Waja olonga ulonzi ukanganya oigangamiza wenyego, lakini waja owapetela wanhu usenga wa Imulungu, wao okigangamiza kibumbila chose cha wanhu wamtogole Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Vinilonda niye mweye mose mulonge ulonzi ukanganya, lakini nolonda ng'hani muwe na nhunza ya kuwapetela wanhu usenga wa Imulungu. Kwavija munhu yeli na nhunza ya kuwapetela wanhu usenga wa Imulungu kofaya ng'hani kubanza ija yolonga ulonzi wa kukanganya, mbaka hawe na munhu wa kufambula mbuli zilongigwa, avo wanhu wose wamtogole Yesu wadahe kugangamizwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Ndugu zangu, vino yowafaya choni naheza kumwenu kulonga na mweye ulonzi ukanganya? Hakiwafaya chochose, mbaka niwalongeleni ugubulo wa Imulungu hebu ubala fulani, hebu usenga wa Imulungu hebu mafundizo fulani.<verse eid="1CO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Vivo ili kwa vinhu vilibule ugima vilava sauti, kamba vija kifengwa, hebu bango. Vino munhu kodahaze kujuwa lwila lutoigwa kamba kifengwa acho hebu bango vahatoigwa havilava sauti vinogile? <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Kamba mhalati hailila goya, nani yonda yaitande kwa kuitowa? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Vivo ili kumwenu mweye, kamba lulimi lwenu halulonga kinhu kijuwika, nani yonda yadahe kugajuwa gomulonga? Kwavija kamba molonga na ubeho. <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Kuna ulonzi mwingi mwiisi, lakini kuduhu ulonzi ulibule fambulo jake. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Lakini nahaleka kujuwa fambulo da ulonzi wa munhu, niye nokuwa munhu baki kumwake nayo kokuwa munhu baki kumwangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Kwavija mweye mosulukila kupata nhunza ya Loho, molondigwa muwambe kuzisang'hanila nhunza azo kwa kuwagangamiza wanhu wamtogole Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Avo munhu yolonga ulonzi ukanganya, kolondigwa yampule Imulungu yapate udahi wa kufambula. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Kwavija nahampula Imulungu kwa ulonzi ukanganya, loho yangu ayo ipula, lakini nzewele zangu zokala bule. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Avo nhende choni? Nompula Imulungu kwa loho yangu, vivija nompula Imulungu kwa nzewele zangu na nokwimba kwa loho yangu, vivija nokwimba kwa nzewele zangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Wahamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu kwa loho yako iiyeka, yodahika vilihi kwa wanhu waiting'hane kwidika nhogolwa zako kwa Imulungu kwa kulonga, “Ona,” kamba hawakijuwa kiulonga? <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Hata kamba nhogolwa zako kwa Imulungu zahanoga vilihi, wanhu wayagwe haziwagangamiza bule.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Nomgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu kwavija niye nolonga ulonzi ukanganya kubanza mweye mose. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Lakini nahaiting'hana na kibumbila cha wanhu wamtogole Yesu, nonogelwa kulonga mbuli tano zijuwika goya ili niwafundize wayagwe, kubanza kulonga mbuli magana kwa magana kwa ulonzi ukanganya. <verse eid="1CO 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Ndugu zangu, sikumugese kamba wana wadodo. Kwa mbuli ya gehile mukale kamba wana ving'hele welibule vitala, lakini mugese kamba viwogesa wanhu wabala goya. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Yandikigwa mna Gamalagizo kamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Mndewa kolonga vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">‘Kubitila wanhu olonga ulonzi ukanganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">na kwa milomo ya wanhu baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">nowalongela wanhu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">lakini hawanitegeleza bule.’ ”<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Avo nhunza ya kulonga ulonzi ukanganya ni kilaguso kwa wanhu hawamtogola Yesu, siyo kwa wanhu wamtogole Yesu, lakini nhunza ya kuwalongela wanhu usenga wa Imulungu ni kilaguso kwa wanhu wamtogole Yesu, siyo kwa wanhu hawamtogole Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Avo, wanhu wose wamtogole Yesu wahaiting'hana hamoja, na wose olonga kwa ulonzi ukanganya, baho waheza wanhu hawajuwa hebu wanhu hawamtogole Yesu, vino honda walonge kuwa mweye mose mna kibozi mbwelela? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Lakini wose wahalonga usenga wa Imulungu, yaheza munhu hajuwile kinhu hebu munhu hamtogola Yesu gose gonda yahulike gomulagusila nzambi zake na vivija gomtagusa. <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>Gaja gafisigwe mmizoyo yao gogubuligwa, nao ofugama na kumtambikila Imulungu, kwa kulonga, “Kweli Imulungu kabaha hamoja na mweye!”<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Viilondigwa kutenda mvibumbila va wanhu wa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Ndugu zangu, nofambula vino, mwahaiting'hana hamoja kumtambikila Imulungu, imoja kana nyila, iyagwe kofundiza, iyagwe kana ugubulo kulawa kwa Imulungu, iyagwe kana nhunza ya kulonga kwa ulonzi ukanganya, na iyagwe kofambula kija kilongigwe. Kila kinhu kiwe kwa kuwagangamiza wanhu waiting'hane. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Kamba munhu kolonga ulonzi ukanganya, wanhu wabili hebu wadatu, walonge imoja imoja, munhu iyagwe kolondigwa yafambule kija kilongigwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Lakini kamba kuduhu munhu yodaha kufambula mbuli ilongigwa, avo ija yolonga kwa ulonzi ukanganya yanyamale, yalonge mwenyego na kwa Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Wanhu wabili hebu wadatu wagweleligwe usenga wa Imulungu, walonge na kuno wayagwe walolese goya gaja gowolonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Na kamba munhu yakalile aho kobokela usenga kwa Imulungu, ija yolonga yanyamale. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Mose modaha kulonga usenga wa Imulungu, imoja imoja, avo kila munhu koifunza na kugangamizwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Nhunza ya kulonga usenga wa Imulungu yolondigwa iwe mmakono ga mulongaji. <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>Kwavija Imulungu siyo Imulungu wa kuding'huka, lakini Imulungu wa tindiwalo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Kamba viili mna ivibumbila vose va wanhu wa Imulungu, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>watwanzi olondigwa wanyamale mna ivibumbila va wanhu wamtogole Yesu. Hawatogoleligwa kulonga, lakini wategeleze, kamba Malagizo ga Wayahudi vigalonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Kamba hana kinhu olonda kukijuwa, wahabwela ukae odaha kuwauza wambigalo zao. Yogela kinyala kwa mtwanzi kulonga mvibumbila va wanhu wamtogole Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Vino, usenga wa Imulungu usonga kumwenu? Hebu uwavikila mweye mwiiyeka? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Kamba mweye moigesa wenyego molonga usenga wa Imulungu hebu wanhu wa Loho, avo muvijuwe kamba nokwandika gaja gaiyeka gayalagize Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Kamba munhu hatonga kija kinyandika, sikumumtonge munhu ayo.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Ndugu zangu, sulukileni kuwapetela wanhu usenga wa Imulungu na sikumumgomese munhu yoyose kulonga ulonzi ukanganya. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Lakini tendeni goya kila kinhu, kamba viilondigwa.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s">Kuzilibuka kwa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Ndugu zangu, lelo nolonda kuwakumbusa Mbuli Inogile iniwapetele, na mweye muibokela, Mbuli ayo Inogile acho chandusilo cha kumtamanila kwenu Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Usenga uniwapeteleni, ayo Mbuli Inogile. Mwahaigoga ng'hani mokomboligwa. Kamba mwahaleka kuigoga mugaya bule kutogola.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Niwagwaa kinhu kikulu ng'hani kimbokele, Kilisito kafa kwa nzambi zetu, kamba Maandiko Gang'alile vigolonga, <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>kamba kazikigwa, abaho siku da kadatu kazilibuka, kamba Maandiko Gang'alile vigolonga, <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>kamulawilila Kefa, abaho kawalawilila watumigwa wose longo na wabili. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Abaho kawalawilila kwa mwanza umoja wanahina zake bwando, kubanza magana matano, wanhu bwando mna iwao wang'hali wagima lakini wayagwe wafa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Kumwande kamulawilila Yakobo, abaho kawalawilila watumigwa wose.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Kukimambukizo kandawilila na niye vivija, hata kamba niigala na munhu yavumbuke kipindi kihile. <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Kwavija mna iwatumigwa wose niye na munhu mdodo ng'hani, niye sifaya hata kukemigwa mtumigwa, kwavija niwadununza wanhu wamtogole Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Lakini kwa ng'hekewa ya Imulungu niwa kamba vinili, na ng'hekewa iyanigwelele hayagile bule. Nisang'hana ng'hani kubanza wayagwe wose, hata avo siyo niye nisang'hane, lakini ng'hekewa ya Imulungu ya hamoja na niye. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Lakini siyo kinhu, kamba niye niwapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile hebu wao wawapetela wanhu. Mweye mose mutogola usenga awo.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzilibuka kwa wafile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Lelo, kamba towapetela wanhu kuwa Imulungu kamzilibula Kilisito kwa wanhu wafile, wanhu wayagwe kumwenu odaha vilihi kulonga kuwa wanhu wafile honda wazilibuke bule? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Kamba kweli wanhu wafile honda wazilibuke bule, yofambula kuwa Kilisito hazilibuke bule. <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>Kamba Kilisito hazilibuke kwa wanhu wafile, togaya bule kuwapetela wanhu na kutamanila kwetu kuduhu kinhu. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Avo tokoneka wavizi mgameso ga Imulungu, kwavija tulonga Imulungu kamzilibula Kilisito kwa wanhu wafile. Kamba kweli, Imulungu hamzilibule Kilisito, avo wanhu wafile honda wazilibuke. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Kwavija kamba wanhu wafile hawazilibuka bule, avo Kilisito hazilibuke bule. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Kamba Kilisito hazilibuke kwa wanhu wafile, kumtamanila kwenu kuduhu kinhu, na mung'hali mopotela mzinzambi zenu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Vivija ino yofambula kuwa waja wamtogole Kilisito abaho wafa, wapotela. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Kamba tomtamanila Kilisito vinogile kwa ugima uno wiiyeka, tofaya koneligwa bazi ng'hani na wanhu kubanza munhu yoyose iyagwe mwiisi.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Lakini kweli Kilisito ayo wa ichanduso kuzilibuka kwa wanhu wafile, ino yolagusa kuwa waja wafile ozilibuka vivija. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Kwavija kamba ifa viigaligwe mwiisi na munhu, vivo ili kuzilibuka kwa wanhu wafile kogaligwa na munhu. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Kwavija kamba wanhu wose viwofa mbuli ya kuilumba kwao na Adamu, vivo ili wanhu wose ozilibuligwa kwa wanhu wafile mbuli ya kuilumba kwao na Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Lakini kila munhu kozilibuligwa mna ikipindi chake, tanhu Kilisito, abaho waja weli wanhu zake mna ikipindi chonda yeze Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Abaho wahavika uhelelo, Kilisito kobananga utawala wose na udahi wose na mamulaka gose, na komgwaa Undewa Imulungu Tata. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Kwavija Kilisito kolondigwa yatawale mbaka Imulungu vonda yawahume wose wamwihile na kuweka hasi ya magulu gake. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Mdumuka wa kimambukizo kubanangigwa kokuwa ifa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Kwavija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, “Imulungu kokwika vinhu vose hasi ya magulu gake.” Avo yahalonga, “Vinhu vose.” Imulungu mwenyego kahaduhu, heyo ayo yokwika vinhu vose hasi ya Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Lakini vinhu vose vahekigwa hasi ya utawala wa Kilisito, nayo Imwana, koika mwenyego hasi ya Imulungu, yekile vinhu vose hasi yake, na Imulungu kovitawala vose kila hanhu.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Kamba wanhu wafile hawazilibuka bule, vino otenda choni wanhu waja obatizigwa mbuli ya wao? Habali obatizigwa mbuli ya wanhu awo wafile? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Na siye, habali twamdizumozumo kila saa? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Ndugu zangu, kila siku na mmabehi na ifa! Magoda ganilinago kumwenu kwa kuilumba na Yesu Kilisito Mndewa wetu gonhenda nonge vino. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Vino mogesa nipata choni kwa kuitowa na wanhu waigalile na ming'onyo ako Efeso? Kamba wanhu wafile hawazilibuka, “Tuje na tung'we, kwavija mayo tofa.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Sikumuwe wabozi, “Mbwiga wehile oibananga tabiya inogile.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Muwe na nzewele na muleke kutenda nzambi, kwavija wanhu wayagwe kumwenu hawamjuwile Imulungu, na nolonga vino kuwagela kinyala.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzilibuka kwa lukuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Wanhu wayagwe odaha kuuza, “Vino, wanhu wafile odaha vilihi kuzilibuka? Na lukuli lwao lokuwaze?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Uuzaji awo wakibozi! Mwahahanda mbeyu, haikota mbaka tanhu ife. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Na kiuhanda ni mbeyu iiyeka, yodaha kuwa mbeyu ya ngano hebu mbeyu ziyagwe, lakini onda wote aho kumwande okuwa mnoga. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Imulungu koitenda mbeyu ayo yote na koigwaa mnoga uyolonda mwenyego, kila mbeyu koigwaa mnoga wake.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Vinhu vose viumbigwe haviigalile. Wanhu, wanyama, ndege na somba wana ng'huli, lakini ng'huli zao haziigalile bule.<verse eid="1CO 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Kuna ng'huli za kuulanga na ng'huli za mwiisi. Unovu wa ng'huli za kuulanga hauigalile na unovu wa ng'huli za mwiisi. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Zuwa dina unovu wake, mbalamwezi vivija ina unovu wake na nhondo vivija zina unovu wake. Hata nhondo vivija haziigalile kwa unovu. <verse eid="1CO 15:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Vivo vonda iwe, kwa waja wafile vonda wazilibuke. Lukuli lwahazikigwa lokola, lwahazilibuka halukola bule. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Lwahazikigwa lwiha, lwahazilibuka lunoga, lwahazikigwa lonyolila lwahazilibuka luna nguvu. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Lwahazikigwa lokuwa lukuli, lwahazilibuka lokuwa lukuli lwa loho. Kamba tuna lukuli lwa kiunhu, vivija tokuwa na lukuli lwa kiloho. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Kwavija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, “Munhu wa ichanduso, Adamu kalumbigwa yawe ugima,” lakini Adamu wa ikimambukizo ayo Loho yowagwaa wanhu ugima. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Siyo lukuli lwa kiloho ulo lulongole, lakini lukuli lwa kiunhu ulo lulongole. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Adamu wa ichanduso, kalumbigwa kwa udongo, Adamu wa kabili kalawa kuulanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Awo weli mwiisi waigala na munhu yaumbigwe kwa udongo, na awo wa kuulanga waigala na heyo yalawile kuulanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Kamba vija vituigalile na heyo yaumbigwe kwa udongo, vivo vonda tuigale na heyo yalawile kuulanga.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Ndugu zangu, nolonda mujuwe kamba, kija kili na lukuli na damu hakidaha kuwa na fungu Muundewa wa Imulungu, na kija kinangika chaduhu fungu da kija kileka kunangika.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Tegelezeni, nowalongeleni mbuli ifisigwe. Wose hatufa bule, lakini wose togaluka. <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>Yolawilila kwa kusinhukiza, himahima kubanza siso vidibwenza. Mhalati ya ikimambukizo yahalila, wanhu wafile ozilibuka, wose togaluka, avo hatufa kabili. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Ng'huli zetu zifa na kunangika, zogaluka kuwa ng'huli zileka kufa hebu kunangika. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Avo yahalawilila vino, lukuli lunangika logaluka sikulunangike na kija kifa honda kife, aho golawilila Maandiko Gang'alile galongile, “Ifa ihumwa na kuhuma kuvika!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>“Ifa, kuhuma kwako kwa kwahi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Ifa, udahi wako wa kulumiza wa kwahi?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Ifa yopata udahi wa kulumiza kulawa kwa nzambi, na nzambi zopata udahi kulawa kwa Malagizo. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Lakini tumgwee nhogolwa Imulungu yotugwaa kuhuma kubitila Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito!<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Avo, ndugu zangu oniwanogela, gangamaleni. Siku zose muhunganike kumsang'hanila Mndewa, kwavija kuduhu kinhu chonda mutende mwiisang'hano ya Mndewa chonda chage bule.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s">Kusanga sente kuwataza wakilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Mwahasanga sente mbuli ya wanhu wa Imulungu, nowalonda mutende kamba vija vinivilongele vibumbila va wanhu wamtogole Yesu ako Galatia. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Kila jumapili kila munhu kumwenu yabagule sente, ziigale na vija vimupatile, zikeni goya, ili vondanize sikumulonde kusanga sente. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Vondanize, nowagwaa baluwa na nhunza zenu waja muwasagule na nowatuma wachole Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Kamba yofaya na niye nichole, aho odaha kuchola na niye.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zoyogesa Paulo kusang'hana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Nahabitila mwiisi ya Makedonia, nokwiza kuwalola, kwavija nogesa kubitila Makedonia. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Sengine nokala na mweye kipindi kidodo, hebu sengine nodaha kukala na mweye kipindi chose cha kihuhwe, avo modaha kunitaza nigendelele na mwanza wangu kokose konda nichole. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Mndewa yahalonda, nokwiza kumwenu kukala ng'hani, kubanza kwima aho kwa kipindi kidodo.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Nokala hano kudibuga da Efeso mbaka siku ya Pentekosite. <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>Kwavija nivuguliligwa lwivi mkulu mbuli ya sang'hano yangu, hamoja hana wanhu bwando ondema.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Timoseo yaheza, mbokeleni goya, kwavija kotenda sang'hano ya Mndewa, kamba niye. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Munhu yoyose sikuyambezeli, lakini mumtaze yagendelele goya na mwanza wake, ili yabwele kumwangu, kwavija niye nombeta hamoja na ndugu zangu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Avo, kwa mbuli ya ndugu yetu Apolo, baho kwa baho nimnanahiza yeze kumwenu hamoja na wanhu wayagwe wamtogole Yesu, lakini halonda bule kwiza sambi, avo yahadahika kokwiza.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Kaleni meso, gangamaleni mditamanilo, muwe magalu na weli na nguvu. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Sang'hano zenu zose muzitende kwa unogelwa.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Ndugu zangu, mojuwa kuwa Sitefana na wanhu wa lubuga lwake wakala wa ichanduso kumtogola Yesu mwiisi ya Akaya. Watenda viwadahile kuwasang'hanila wanhu wa Imulungu. Ndugu zangu, nowapula, <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>wategelezeni wanhu kamba wano, na munhu yoyose iyagwe yosang'hana hamoja na wao.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Nodeng'helela ng'hani kwavija Sitefana, Folitunata na Akaiko wavika hano. Kukala kwao hano, ni kamba wasola hanhu ha kukala na mweye. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Wautenda moyo wangu usamhuke ng'hani, kamba viwawatendile mweye musamhuke. Wategelezeni wanhu kamba wao.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Vibumbila va wanhu wamtogole Yesu mwiisi ya Asiya kwa kuilumba na Kilisito vowalamuseni ng'hani. Akula na Pilisila na wanhu wa Imulungu weli mzing'anda zao, omulamuseni kwa twaga da Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Wanhu wose hano wamtogole Yesu omulamuseni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Muilamuse kwa nzila ilagusa moinogela.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Niye Paulo nowalamusa, nokwandika kwa makono gangu mwenyego.<verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Munhu yoyose hamnogela Mndewa, yaduwiligwe na Imulungu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">Mndewa wetu izo!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Ng'hekewa ya Mndewa Yesu ikale hamoja na mweye.<verse eid="1CO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Nowanogela mose kwa kuilumba na Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
